  "body": "<p class=\"reference\" data-aid=\"170144743\" id=\"p_gBGlJ\">‘22–28 maart. “Graf, waar is uw overwinning?”: Paasweek’, <cite>Kom dan en volg Mij – voor thuis en in de kerk: Nieuwe Testament 2027</cite> (2027)</p>\n<p class=\"short-reference\" data-aid=\"170144760\" id=\"p_wPPje\">‘22–28 maart. “Graf, waar is uw overwinning?”’, <cite>Kom dan en volg Mij: 2027</cite></p>\n<header>\n<img alt=\"foto van een leeg graf\" id=\"img_tfrwi\" src=\"https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/bda36388333c85eedb166e86304c8b80e9070c1b/full/%21100%2C/0/default\" data-assetId=\"bda36388333c85eedb166e86304c8b80e9070c1b\" srcset=\"https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/bda36388333c85eedb166e86304c8b80e9070c1b/full/%2160%2C/0/default 60w,https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/bda36388333c85eedb166e86304c8b80e9070c1b/full/%21100%2C/0/default 100w,https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/bda36388333c85eedb166e86304c8b80e9070c1b/full/%21200%2C/0/default 200w,https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/bda36388333c85eedb166e86304c8b80e9070c1b/full/%21250%2C/0/default 250w,https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/bda36388333c85eedb166e86304c8b80e9070c1b/full/%21320%2C/0/default 320w,https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/bda36388333c85eedb166e86304c8b80e9070c1b/full/%21500%2C/0/default 500w,https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/bda36388333c85eedb166e86304c8b80e9070c1b/full/%21640%2C/0/default 640w\" data-img-id=\"bda36388333c85eedb166e86304c8b80e9070c1b\" data-missing-asset=\"false\" data-width=\"100\" data-height=\"56\" data-aspect-ratio=\"1.7857142857142858\" data-public-title=\"Garden Tomb Jerusalem\" data-public-description=\"Garden Tomb Jerusalem\"/>\n<p class=\"title-number\" data-aid=\"170144764\" id=\"p_eltNd\">22–28 maart: ‘Graf, waar is uw overwinning?’</p>\n<h1 data-aid=\"170144776\" id=\"p_vx4HH\">Paasweek</h1>\n</header>\n<div class=\"body-block\">\n<p data-aid=\"170144788\" id=\"p_e6At1\">In de laatste week van het leven van de Heiland vierden velen om Hem heen de tradities van het Pascha. Ze bereidden maaltijden, zongen liederen en kwamen bijeen om de bevrijding van het huis van Israël uit de slavernij in Egypte te gedenken. Gezinnen luisterden naar het verhaal van de engel der verwoesting die voorbijging aan de deuren waar het bloed van een lam op de deurposten was aangebracht. Te midden van die vieringen vol symboliek van bevrijding, beseften de meeste mensen niet dat Jezus Christus, het Lam van God, op het punt stond ze te bevrijden van een andere soort slavernij. Door zijn offer en opstanding zou Hij ze van de slavernij van zonde en de dood bevrijden. Sommigen herkenden Jezus echter wel als hun eeuwige Verlosser. Sindsdien hebben discipelen van Jezus Christus tot de hele wereld getuigd dat ‘Hij is opgewekt’! (<span class=\"legacy-scripture-ref\" data-legacy-href=\"../../scriptures/nt/matt/28.html?id=p6#p6\">Mattheüs 28:6</span>.)</p>\n<section id=\"sec_lOqvZ\">\n<header>\n<h2 data-aid=\"170144805\" id=\"p_gsFeR\">Aanbevolen dagelijkse studie</h2>\n</header>\n<figure class=\"for-teacher\" data-purpose=\"teaching-improvement\" id=\"fig_dzGGg\">\n<p data-aid=\"170144832\" id=\"p_kjBic\"><strong>Een dagelijks studieplan.</strong> Sommige mensen bestuderen in de week voor Pasen graag de laatste week van het leven van de Heiland. Hier is een eenvoudig dagelijks studieschema dat je kunt volgen. We weten niet precies op welke dag van de week sommige van deze gebeurtenissen plaatsvonden, en er zijn veel andere belangrijke dingen gebeurd in die heilige week. Maar dit schema kan je elke dag iets zinvols geven om over na te denken ter voorbereiding op het vieren van de opstanding van de Heiland op paaszondag. Je kunt dit gebruiken als leidraad voor je studie, individueel of als gezin.</p>\n</figure>\n<section id=\"sec_dGeNV\">\n<header>\n<p class=\"scripture-title\" data-aid=\"170144849\" id=\"p_ft32h\"><span class=\"legacy-scripture-ref\" data-legacy-href=\"../../scriptures/nt/matt/21.html?id=p1-p11#p1\">Mattheüs 21:1–11</span></p>\n<h3 data-aid=\"170144866\" id=\"p_pf3UK\">Palmzondag: ‘Gezegend is de Koning, Die daar komt in de Naam van de Heere.’</h3>\n</header>\n<p data-aid=\"170144884\" id=\"p_m6OI6\">Merk op hoe het volk in Jeruzalem Jezus in hun stad verwelkomde. Hoe verwelkom jij Hem in je leven?</p>\n<p data-aid=\"170144895\" id=\"p_e7JmX\">Als je erbij was geweest toen de mensen vroegen: ‘Wie is Dat?’, hoe zou jij hun dan hebben uitgelegd wie Jezus is?</p>\n<p data-aid=\"170144915\" id=\"p_cTmBW\">Zie ook <span class=\"legacy-scripture-ref\" data-legacy-href=\"../../scriptures/nt/mark/11.html?id=p1-p11#p1\">Markus 11:1–11</span>; <span class=\"legacy-scripture-ref\" data-legacy-href=\"../../scriptures/nt/luke/19.html?id=p28-p40#p28\">Lukas 19:28–40</span>; <span class=\"legacy-scripture-ref\" data-legacy-href=\"../../scriptures/nt/john/12.html?id=p12-p15#p12\">Johannes 12:12–15</span>; Ronald A. Rasband, ‘<a class=\"cross-ref\" href=\"/study/general-conference/2023/04/53rasband?lang=nld\">Hosanna de allerhoogste God</a>’, <cite>Liahona</cite>, mei 2023, 108–112; ‘The Lord’s Triumphal Entry into Jerusalem’ (video), Gospel Library; ‘<a class=\"cross-ref\" href=\"/study/manual/new-testament-scripture-stories/37-jerusalem?lang=nld\">Jesus Goes to Jerusalem</a>’ [Jezus gaat naar Jeruzalem], in <cite>New Testament Stories</cite> [Verhalen uit het Nieuwe Testament].</p>\n<figure class=\"video\" id=\"figure6\"><video preload=\"none\" controls=\"controls\" poster=\"https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/5eb8b4525d71b27a58241d029f313e95aa2097e1/full/%21768%2C/0/default\" thumbnail=\"https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/5eb8b4525d71b27a58241d029f313e95aa2097e1/full/%21192%2C/0/default\" data-video-title=\"The Lord's Triumphal Entry into Jerusalem\" data-video-description=\"Jesus rides in triumph into Jerusalem. The multitudes greet Him with shouts of &quot;Hosanna to the Son of David.&quot; Matthew 21:1–11\" data-video-id=\"6380848438112\" data-ip=\"Download and Streaming                            \" data-duration=\"82415\" data-assetId=\"b722f27d98e061a31f5ed52b88c2690266604ece\" data-ref-id=\"b722f27d98e061a31f5ed52b88c2690266604ece\" data-duration-string=\"1:22\" id=\"video1\"><source src=\"https://mediasrv.churchofjesuschrist.org/vod/stream/1241706627001/6380848438112.m3u8\" type=\"application/vnd.apple.mpegurl\" data-width=\"1920\" data-height=\"1080\" data-file-size=\"36275833\"/><source src=\"https://assets.churchofjesuschrist.org/b722f27d98e061a31f5ed52b88c2690266604ece-360p-en.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\" data-width=\"640\" data-height=\"360\" data-file-size=\"9135083\"/><source src=\"https://assets.churchofjesuschrist.org/b722f27d98e061a31f5ed52b88c2690266604ece-720p-en.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\" data-width=\"1280\" data-height=\"720\" data-file-size=\"16138005\"/><source src=\"https://assets.churchofjesuschrist.org/b722f27d98e061a31f5ed52b88c2690266604ece-1080p-en.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\" data-width=\"1920\" data-height=\"1080\" data-file-size=\"36275833\"/></video><figcaption><header><p class=\"title\">The Lord's Triumphal Entry into Jerusalem</p></header></figcaption></figure>\n</section>\n<section id=\"sec_vD6em\">\n<header>\n<p class=\"scripture-title\" data-aid=\"170144930\" id=\"p_npims\"><span class=\"legacy-scripture-ref\" data-legacy-href=\"../../scriptures/nt/matt/21.html?id=p12-p16#p12\">Mattheüs 21:12–16</span></p>\n<h3 data-aid=\"170144952\" id=\"p_t8iho\">Maandag: ‘Mijn huis zal een huis van gebed genoemd worden.’</h3>\n</header>\n<ul class=\"bullet\">\n<li>\n<p data-aid=\"170144967\" id=\"p_rFDbg\">Wat kom je door de woorden en daden van de Heiland in deze verzen over Hem en de tempel te weten?</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-aid=\"170144987\" id=\"p_rnE8Y\">Hoe heb jij genezing gevonden in het huis van de Heer?</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-aid=\"170145009\" id=\"p_nA3gF\">Zing, beluister of lees ‘<span class=\"legacy-cross-ref\" data-legacy-href=\"../../music/hymns-for-home-and-church/holy-places.html\">Holy Places</span>’ (<cite>Hymns – For Home and Church</cite>, Gospel Library). Hoe helpt de Heiland je om van jouw huis en hart een ‘heilige plaats’ te maken?</p>\n<p data-aid=\"170145031\" id=\"p_olVde\">Zie ook <span class=\"legacy-scripture-ref\" data-legacy-href=\"../../scriptures/nt/mark/11.html?id=p15-p17#p15\">Markus 11:15–17</span>; <span class=\"legacy-scripture-ref\" data-legacy-href=\"../../scriptures/nt/luke/19.html?id=p45-p46#p45\">Lukas 19:45–46</span>; ‘Jesus Cleanses the Temple’ (video), Gospel Library.</p>\n<figure class=\"video\" id=\"figure7\"><video preload=\"none\" controls=\"controls\" poster=\"https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/7728e359e7e11fc5a5cbab4b44c2de5b9b1fbcab/full/%21768%2C/0/default\" thumbnail=\"https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/7728e359e7e11fc5a5cbab4b44c2de5b9b1fbcab/full/%21192%2C/0/default\" data-video-title=\"Jesus Cleanses the Temple\" data-video-description=\"Jesus clears worldly merchandise from the temple courts in order to keep the temple a holy place.\" data-video-id=\"6380850557112\" data-ip=\"Download and Streaming                            \" data-duration=\"94000\" data-assetId=\"2456115651b71f87ebfa1f5bebed602132f76298\" data-ref-id=\"2456115651b71f87ebfa1f5bebed602132f76298\" data-duration-string=\"1:34\" id=\"video2\"><source src=\"https://mediasrv.churchofjesuschrist.org/vod/stream/1241706627001/6380850557112.m3u8\" type=\"application/vnd.apple.mpegurl\" data-width=\"1920\" data-height=\"1080\" data-file-size=\"42178007\"/><source src=\"https://assets.churchofjesuschrist.org/2456115651b71f87ebfa1f5bebed602132f76298-360p-en.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\" data-width=\"640\" data-height=\"360\" data-file-size=\"10676680\"/><source src=\"https://assets.churchofjesuschrist.org/2456115651b71f87ebfa1f5bebed602132f76298-720p-en.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\" data-width=\"1280\" data-height=\"720\" data-file-size=\"18733511\"/><source src=\"https://assets.churchofjesuschrist.org/2456115651b71f87ebfa1f5bebed602132f76298-1080p-en.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\" data-width=\"1920\" data-height=\"1080\" data-file-size=\"42178007\"/></video><figcaption><header><p class=\"title\">Jesus Cleanses the Temple</p></header></figcaption></figure>\n</section>\n<section id=\"sec_uBN9p\">\n<header>\n<p class=\"scripture-title\" data-aid=\"170145052\" id=\"p_pPeSu\"><span class=\"legacy-scripture-ref\" data-legacy-href=\"../../scriptures/nt/matt/22.html?id=p1-p14#p1\">Mattheüs 22:1–14</span></p>\n<h3 data-aid=\"170145074\" id=\"p_fxRmZ\">Dinsdag: ‘Velen zijn geroepen, maar weinigen uitverkoren.’</h3>\n</header>\n<p data-aid=\"170145096\" id=\"p_lAzKo\">Een van de vele gelijkenissen die Jezus in zijn laatste week gaf, ging over een koning die mensen uitnodigde voor de bruiloft van zijn zoon. Kijk eens of je boodschappen voor jou kunt herkennen in deze gelijkenis. Probeer ze op te schrijven – er kunnen er meerdere zijn.</p>\n<ul class=\"bullet\">\n<li>\n<p data-aid=\"170145118\" id=\"p_rSS4U\">Waarom was het belangrijk dat Jezus deze boodschappen in de dagen vóór zijn zoenoffer verkondigde?</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-aid=\"170145140\" id=\"p_vzIjy\">Zie ook David A. Bednar, ‘<a class=\"cross-ref\" href=\"/study/general-conference/2022/10/46bednar?lang=nld\">Bekleed u met sterkte, o Zion</a>’, <cite>Liahona</cite>, november 2022, 92–95.</p>\n</section>\n<section id=\"sec_nFHKG\">\n<header>\n<p class=\"scripture-title\" data-aid=\"170145161\" id=\"p_qvC8E\"><span class=\"legacy-scripture-ref\" data-legacy-href=\"../../scriptures/nt/matt/25.html?id=p31-p46#p31\">Mattheüs 25:31–46</span></p>\n<h3 data-aid=\"170145182\" id=\"p_zokmF\">Woensdag: ‘U [hebt] dat voor Mij gedaan.’</h3>\n</header>\n<p data-aid=\"170145203\" id=\"p_z1J3K\">In <span class=\"legacy-scripture-ref\" data-legacy-href=\"../../scriptures/nt/matt/25.html?id=p31-p46#p31\">Mattheüs 25:31–46</span> legt de Heiland het belangrijkste verschil uit tussen wie het koninkrijk beërven en wie dat niet doen. Hoe zou je dat verschil samenvatten?</p>\n<p data-aid=\"170145224\" id=\"p_ym4T0\">Als je deze verzen leest, denk je misschien aan iemand die lichamelijk, geestelijk of emotioneel in nood verkeert. Hoe kun je ze daarbij helpen?</p>\n<ul class=\"bullet\">\n<li>\n<p data-aid=\"170145245\" id=\"p_moYq5\">Waarom is iets voor ‘deze geringsten’ doen hetzelfde als het voor de Heiland doen?</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-aid=\"170145266\" id=\"p_i8FC7\">Zie ook ‘<span class=\"legacy-cross-ref\" data-legacy-href=\"../../manual/hymns/have-i-done-any-good.html\">Have I Done Any Good?</span>’, <cite>Hymns</cite>, 223; ‘<a class=\"cross-ref\" href=\"/study/manual/new-testament-scripture-stories/41-ye-have-done-it-unto-me?lang=nld\">Ye Have Done It unto Me</a>’ [U hebt dat voor Mij gedaan], in <cite>New Testament Stories</cite> [Verhalen uit het Nieuwe Testament].</p>\n</section>\n<section id=\"sec_dXE3E\">\n<header>\n<figure class=\"image no-print\" id=\"fig_c9631\">\n<img alt=\"Christus in Gethsémané\" id=\"img_wyDfq\" src=\"https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/1c2413340f1911ef92c5eeeeac1eb3d4e4ffbb9d/full/%21500%2C/0/default\" data-assetId=\"1c2413340f1911ef92c5eeeeac1eb3d4e4ffbb9d\" srcset=\"https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/1c2413340f1911ef92c5eeeeac1eb3d4e4ffbb9d/full/%2160%2C/0/default 60w,https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/1c2413340f1911ef92c5eeeeac1eb3d4e4ffbb9d/full/%21100%2C/0/default 100w,https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/1c2413340f1911ef92c5eeeeac1eb3d4e4ffbb9d/full/%21200%2C/0/default 200w,https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/1c2413340f1911ef92c5eeeeac1eb3d4e4ffbb9d/full/%21250%2C/0/default 250w,https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/1c2413340f1911ef92c5eeeeac1eb3d4e4ffbb9d/full/%21320%2C/0/default 320w,https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/1c2413340f1911ef92c5eeeeac1eb3d4e4ffbb9d/full/%21500%2C/0/default 500w,https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/1c2413340f1911ef92c5eeeeac1eb3d4e4ffbb9d/full/%21640%2C/0/default 640w\" data-img-id=\"1c2413340f1911ef92c5eeeeac1eb3d4e4ffbb9d\" data-missing-asset=\"false\" data-width=\"500\" data-height=\"281\" data-aspect-ratio=\"1.7793594306049823\" data-public-title=\"Gethsemane\" data-public-description=\"Painting portraying Jesus Christ lying on the ground in the garden of Gethsemane.  A ray of light is coming through the trees.\"/>\n<div class=\"credit\">\n<p data-aid=\"170145287\" id=\"p_c33nw\">Met toestemming gebruikt. <cite>Gethsémané</cite>, Adam Abram. Met dank aan <span class=\"language\" lang=\"eng\">altusfineart.com</span> © 2025.</p>\n</div>\n</figure>\n<p class=\"scripture-title\" data-aid=\"170145308\" id=\"p_uIkCk\"><span class=\"legacy-scripture-ref\" data-legacy-href=\"../../scriptures/nt/matt/26.html\">Mattheüs 26</span></p>\n<h3 data-aid=\"170145329\" id=\"p_ulapT\">Donderdag: ‘Niet zoals Ik wil, maar zoals U wilt.’</h3>\n</header>\n<p data-aid=\"170145350\" id=\"p_kMMrL\">Hier zijn enkele vragen die je kunt overdenken terwijl je over de heilige gebeurtenissen in <span class=\"legacy-scripture-ref\" data-legacy-href=\"../../scriptures/nt/matt/26.html\">Mattheüs 26</span> leest:</p>\n<ul class=\"bullet\">\n<li>\n<p data-aid=\"170145371\" id=\"p_gHoUJ\"><span class=\"legacy-scripture-ref\" data-legacy-href=\"../../scriptures/nt/matt/26.html?id=p6-p13#p6\">Vers 6–13</span>: Wat leek deze vrouw te begrijpen en te voelen dat de andere discipelen niet deden? Hoe kun je door je daden laten zien wat je van de Heiland en zijn zending vindt? (Zie ook <span class=\"legacy-scripture-ref\" data-legacy-href=\"../../scriptures/nt/john/12.html?id=p2-p8#p2\">Johannes 12:2–8</span>.)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-aid=\"170145392\" id=\"p_aoQ01\"><span class=\"legacy-scripture-ref\" data-legacy-href=\"../../scriptures/nt/matt/26.html?id=p26-p30#p26\">Vers 26–30</span>: Denk na over de symbolen die Jezus koos om ons aan Hem te herinneren. Wat kunnen we van elk daarvan leren? Hoe zou je aan iemand uitleggen waarom het avondmaal voor jou heilig is? (Zie ook <span class=\"legacy-scripture-ref\" data-legacy-href=\"../../scriptures/nt/luke/22.html?id=p15-p20#p15\">Lukas 22:15–20</span>.)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-aid=\"170145413\" id=\"p_eP583\"><span class=\"legacy-scripture-ref\" data-legacy-href=\"../../scriptures/nt/matt/26.html?id=p36-p46#p36\">Vers 36–46</span>: Welke karaktereigenschappen van Jezus Christus vind je in deze verzen? Wat zou je zeggen als je de kans had om met Hem over zijn lijden in Gethsémané te praten? (Zie ook <span class=\"legacy-scripture-ref\" data-legacy-href=\"../../scriptures/nt/mark/14.html?id=p32-p42#p32\">Markus 14:32–42</span>; <span class=\"legacy-scripture-ref\" data-legacy-href=\"../../scriptures/nt/luke/22.html?id=p39-p46#p39\">Lukas 22:39–46</span>.)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-aid=\"170145434\" id=\"p_bWpYX\">Zie ook ‘<span class=\"legacy-cross-ref\" data-legacy-href=\"../../manual/hymns/thy-will-o-lord-be-done.html\">Thy Will, O Lord, Be Done</span>’, <cite>Hymns</cite>, 188; ‘The Last Supper’, ‘The Savior Suffers in Gethsemane’ (video’s), Gospel Library; ‘The Last Supper’ [Het laatste avondmaal], ‘<a class=\"cross-ref\" href=\"/study/manual/new-testament-scripture-stories/43-garden-of-gethsemane?lang=nld\">Jesus in the Garden of Gethsemane</a>’ [Jezus in de hof van Gethsémané], in <cite>New Testament Stories</cite> [Verhalen uit het Nieuwe Testament]; ‘Gethsemane’ (muziekvideo), Gospel Library.</p>\n<figure class=\"video\" id=\"figure8\"><video preload=\"none\" controls=\"controls\" poster=\"https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/09e0fdc467e2f7c4b59725da319ed0f7f6b0abb8/full/%21768%2C/0/default\" thumbnail=\"https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/09e0fdc467e2f7c4b59725da319ed0f7f6b0abb8/full/%21192%2C/0/default\" data-video-title=\"The Last Supper\" data-video-description=\"Meeting in an upper room with His disciples, Jesus washes their feet, institutes the sacrament, and commands them to love one another. John 13:1–35\" data-video-id=\"6380849152112\" data-ip=\"Download and Streaming                            \" data-duration=\"371621\" data-assetId=\"ee6f196fc3bd55a332e1ebdfd4e89db03b70a83d\" data-ref-id=\"ee6f196fc3bd55a332e1ebdfd4e89db03b70a83d\" data-duration-string=\"6:11\" id=\"video3\"><source src=\"https://mediasrv.churchofjesuschrist.org/vod/stream/1241706627001/6380849152112.m3u8\" type=\"application/vnd.apple.mpegurl\" data-width=\"1920\" data-height=\"1080\" data-file-size=\"116035199\"/><source src=\"https://assets.churchofjesuschrist.org/ee6f196fc3bd55a332e1ebdfd4e89db03b70a83d-360p-en.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\" data-width=\"640\" data-height=\"360\" data-file-size=\"27291008\"/><source src=\"https://assets.churchofjesuschrist.org/ee6f196fc3bd55a332e1ebdfd4e89db03b70a83d-720p-en.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\" data-width=\"1280\" data-height=\"720\" data-file-size=\"52146095\"/><source src=\"https://assets.churchofjesuschrist.org/ee6f196fc3bd55a332e1ebdfd4e89db03b70a83d-1080p-en.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\" data-width=\"1920\" data-height=\"1080\" data-file-size=\"116035199\"/></video><figcaption><header><p class=\"title\">The Last Supper</p></header></figcaption></figure>\n<figure class=\"video\" id=\"figure9\"><video preload=\"none\" controls=\"controls\" poster=\"https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/87537d1faba15ebf55a7a756eb1d808ed40aa4b8/full/%21768%2C/0/default\" thumbnail=\"https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/87537d1faba15ebf55a7a756eb1d808ed40aa4b8/full/%21192%2C/0/default\" data-video-title=\"Het lijden van de Heiland in Gethsémané\" data-video-description=\"Jezus, Petrus, Jakobus en Johannes trekken zich terug in de hof van Gethsémané. Jezus onderwerpt Zich aan de wil van de Vader en lijdt voor de zonden en de ellende van de mensheid. Vervolgens wordt Hij verraden en gevangengenomen. Mattheüs 26:36–57\" data-video-id=\"2215148912001\" data-ip=\"Download and Streaming                            \" data-duration=\"510760\" data-assetId=\"df949017d6bf0aa014453ef7af6c3450bb95f02b\" data-ref-id=\"df949017d6bf0aa014453ef7af6c3450bb95f02b\" data-duration-string=\"8:30\" id=\"video4\"><source src=\"https://mediasrv.churchofjesuschrist.org/vod/stream/1241706627001/2215148912001.m3u8\" type=\"application/vnd.apple.mpegurl\" data-width=\"720\" data-height=\"360\" data-file-size=\"41403875\"/><source src=\"https://assets.churchofjesuschrist.org/df949017d6bf0aa014453ef7af6c3450bb95f02b-360p-nl.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\" data-width=\"720\" data-height=\"360\" data-file-size=\"41403875\"/></video><figcaption><header><p class=\"title\">Het lijden van de Heiland in Gethsémané</p></header></figcaption></figure>\n<figure class=\"video\" id=\"figure10\"><video preload=\"none\" controls=\"controls\" poster=\"https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/886F40EA2336DD6E669EB3ED45D9DE599633682B/full/%21768%2C/0/default\" thumbnail=\"https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/886F40EA2336DD6E669EB3ED45D9DE599633682B/full/%21192%2C/0/default\" data-video-title=\"Gethsemane\" data-video-description=\"A musical montage and sing-along featuring the song, &quot;Gethsemane&quot; by Melanie Hoffman.\" data-video-id=\"5738042442001\" data-ip=\"Download and Streaming                            \" data-duration=\"202902\" data-assetId=\"f18513673f04afa9f17e02a25ba7c87e822b589c\" data-ref-id=\"f18513673f04afa9f17e02a25ba7c87e822b589c\" data-duration-string=\"3:22\" id=\"video5\"><source src=\"https://mediasrv.churchofjesuschrist.org/vod/stream/1241706627001/5738042442001.m3u8\" type=\"application/vnd.apple.mpegurl\" data-width=\"1920\" data-height=\"1080\" data-file-size=\"44993268\"/><source src=\"https://assets.churchofjesuschrist.org/f18513673f04afa9f17e02a25ba7c87e822b589c-360p-en.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\" data-width=\"640\" data-height=\"360\" data-file-size=\"12679287\"/><source src=\"https://assets.churchofjesuschrist.org/f18513673f04afa9f17e02a25ba7c87e822b589c-720p-en.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\" data-width=\"1280\" data-height=\"720\" data-file-size=\"20448475\"/><source src=\"https://assets.churchofjesuschrist.org/f18513673f04afa9f17e02a25ba7c87e822b589c-1080p-en.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\" data-width=\"1920\" data-height=\"1080\" data-file-size=\"44993268\"/></video><figcaption><header><p class=\"title\">Gethsemane</p></header></figcaption></figure>\n</section>\n<section id=\"sec_c5Wdt\">\n<header>\n<p class=\"scripture-title\" data-aid=\"170145455\" id=\"p_cFW4m\"><span class=\"legacy-scripture-ref\" data-legacy-href=\"../../scriptures/nt/matt/27.html\">Mattheüs 27</span></p>\n<h3 data-aid=\"170145476\" id=\"p_yOw3D\">Goede Vrijdag: ‘Werkelijk, Dit was Gods Zoon!’</h3>\n</header>\n<p data-aid=\"170145497\" id=\"p_n6aPK\">Sommige mensen die aanwezig waren bij de kruisiging van Jezus, zeiden dat ze zouden geloven dat Hij Gods Zoon was als Hij van het kruis afkwam (<span class=\"legacy-scripture-ref\" data-legacy-href=\"../../scriptures/nt/matt/27.html?id=p42#p42\">Mattheüs 27:42</span>). Maar een andere getuige van de kruisiging van de kruisiging van de Heiland – een Romeinse soldaat – verklaarde: ‘Werkelijk, Dit was Gods Zoon!’ (<span class=\"legacy-scripture-ref\" data-legacy-href=\"../../scriptures/nt/matt/27.html?id=p54#p54\">Mattheüs 27:54</span>; zie ook <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/mosiah/27?lang=nld&amp;id=p31#p31\">Mosiah 27:31</a>.)</p>\n<ul class=\"bullet\">\n<li>\n<p data-aid=\"170145517\" id=\"p_xtr2k\">Wat staat er in <span class=\"legacy-scripture-ref\" data-legacy-href=\"../../scriptures/nt/matt/27.html\">Mattheüs 27</span> dat je geloof versterkt dat Jezus Christus werkelijk de Zoon van God is?</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-aid=\"170148537\" id=\"p_lItUi\">Zie ook <span class=\"legacy-scripture-ref\" data-legacy-href=\"../../scriptures/nt/luke/23.html\">Lukas 23</span>; <span class=\"legacy-scripture-ref\" data-legacy-href=\"../../scriptures/nt/john/19.html\">Johannes 19</span>; ‘<a class=\"cross-ref\" href=\"/study/manual/hymns/behold-the-great-redeemer-die?lang=nld\">Aanschouw, de grote Redder stierf</a>’, <cite>Lofzangen</cite>, nr. 127; ‘Jesus Is Condemned before Pilate’, ‘Jesus Is Scourged and Crucified’ (video’s), Gospel Library; ‘<a class=\"cross-ref\" href=\"/study/manual/new-testament-scripture-stories/45-jesus-gives-his-life?lang=nld\">Jesus Gives His Life for Us</a>’ [Jezus geeft zijn leven voor ons], in <cite>New Testament Stories</cite> [Verhalen uit het Nieuwe Testament].</p>\n<figure class=\"image no-print\" id=\"fig_yzTaL\">\n<img alt=\"schilderij van Christus aan het kruis\" id=\"img_oWt7T\" src=\"https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/adff0f8d06332eb661d2a8e13307c4f7668972fb/full/%21500%2C/0/default\" data-assetId=\"adff0f8d06332eb661d2a8e13307c4f7668972fb\" srcset=\"https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/adff0f8d06332eb661d2a8e13307c4f7668972fb/full/%2160%2C/0/default 60w,https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/adff0f8d06332eb661d2a8e13307c4f7668972fb/full/%21100%2C/0/default 100w,https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/adff0f8d06332eb661d2a8e13307c4f7668972fb/full/%21200%2C/0/default 200w,https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/adff0f8d06332eb661d2a8e13307c4f7668972fb/full/%21250%2C/0/default 250w,https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/adff0f8d06332eb661d2a8e13307c4f7668972fb/full/%21320%2C/0/default 320w,https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/adff0f8d06332eb661d2a8e13307c4f7668972fb/full/%21500%2C/0/default 500w,https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/adff0f8d06332eb661d2a8e13307c4f7668972fb/full/%21640%2C/0/default 640w\" data-img-id=\"adff0f8d06332eb661d2a8e13307c4f7668972fb\" data-missing-asset=\"false\" data-width=\"500\" data-height=\"281\" data-aspect-ratio=\"1.7793594306049823\" data-public-title=\"Crucifixion of Christ, The\" data-public-description=\"Jesus Christ and the two thieves depicted during the Crucifixion. The Apostle John is standing below the cross of Christ. Mary, the mother of Christ is standing beside John. Two other women are kneeling at the base of the cross. There are Roman soldiers and Jews standing in the background.\"/>\n<figcaption>\n<p data-aid=\"170148557\" id=\"p_wxamy\"><cite>De kruisiging van Christus</cite>, Louise Parker</p>\n</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure class=\"video\" id=\"figure11\"><video preload=\"none\" controls=\"controls\" poster=\"https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/83c2e7174f13c49db167542ea008cc525ce01092/full/%21768%2C/0/default\" thumbnail=\"https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/83c2e7174f13c49db167542ea008cc525ce01092/full/%21192%2C/0/default\" data-video-title=\"Jesus Is Scourged and Crucified\" data-video-description=\"A band of soldiers strips Jesus of His clothes, scourges Him, and mocks Him. He then carries His cross to Golgotha and is crucified by Roman soldiers. Matthew 27:26–50\" data-video-id=\"6380849733112\" data-ip=\"Download and Streaming                            \" data-duration=\"284909\" data-assetId=\"61d5b574f7709c77a71a9e243feee51dc1f7af9f\" data-ref-id=\"61d5b574f7709c77a71a9e243feee51dc1f7af9f\" data-duration-string=\"4:44\" id=\"video6\"><source src=\"https://mediasrv.churchofjesuschrist.org/vod/stream/1241706627001/6380849733112.m3u8\" type=\"application/vnd.apple.mpegurl\" data-width=\"1920\" data-height=\"960\" data-file-size=\"288322841\"/><source src=\"https://media2.ldscdn.org/assets/scripture-and-lesson-support/the-life-of-jesus-christ-bible-videos/2011-10-019-jesus-is-scourged-and-crucified-1080p-eng.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\" data-width=\"1920\" data-height=\"960\" data-file-size=\"288322841\"/></video><figcaption><header><p class=\"title\">Jesus Is Scourged and Crucified</p></header></figcaption></figure>\n</section>\n<section id=\"sec_ril5v\">\n<header>\n<p class=\"scripture-title\" data-aid=\"170148577\" id=\"p_iSJJ4\"><span class=\"legacy-scripture-ref\" data-legacy-href=\"../../scriptures/nt/1-pet/3.html?id=p18-p20#p18\">1 Petrus 3:18–20</span>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/dc-testament/dc/138?lang=nld\">Leer en Verbonden 138</a></p>\n<h3 data-aid=\"170148597\" id=\"p_nbycw\">Zaterdag: ‘Toen Hij heenging, [heeft Hij] aan de geesten in de gevangenis gepredikt.’</h3>\n</header>\n<p data-aid=\"170148617\" id=\"p_bTjC2\">Wat deed Jezus als geest toen zijn lichaam in het graf lag? De eerste brief van Petrus licht een tipje van de sluier op. En hedendaagse openbaring trekt die sluier helemaal open! Denk na over <span class=\"legacy-scripture-ref\" data-legacy-href=\"../../scriptures/nt/1-pet/3.html?id=p18-p20#p18\">1 Petrus 3:18–20</span> en <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/dc-testament/dc/138?lang=nld\">Leer en Verbonden 138</a> en stel jezelf de vraag:</p>\n<ul class=\"bullet\">\n<li>\n<p data-aid=\"170148637\" id=\"p_u1RSA\">Wat kom ik door de bediening van de Heiland in de geestenwereld over Hem en zijn verzoening te weten?</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-aid=\"170148657\" id=\"p_qiqlw\">Welk bewijs van de liefde en barmhartigheid van onze hemelse Vader voor zijn kinderen kan ik in deze openbaringen vinden?</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-aid=\"170148677\" id=\"p_vGbro\">Zie ook Onderwerpen en vragen, ‘<a class=\"cross-ref\" href=\"/study/manual/gospel-topics/spirit-world-study-guide?lang=nld\">Geestenwereld</a>’, Evangeliebibliotheek; ‘<span class=\"legacy-cross-ref\" data-legacy-href=\"../../manual/hymns/the-glorious-gospel-light-has-shone.html\">The Glorious Gospel Light Has Shone</span>’, <cite>Hymns</cite>, 283; ‘<a class=\"cross-ref\" href=\"/study/manual/doctrine-and-covenants-stories-2025/48-susa-young-gates?lang=nld&amp;id=p_nhKml#p_nhKml\">Susa Young Gates en Joseph F. Smith</a>’, in <cite>Verhalen uit de Leer en Verbonden</cite>.</p>\n<figure class=\"video\" id=\"figure12\"><video preload=\"none\" controls=\"controls\" poster=\"https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/dwutgmj57rrzcnftisy3ll8txg0cujvsbb4fqirz/full/%21768%2C/0/default\" thumbnail=\"https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/dwutgmj57rrzcnftisy3ll8txg0cujvsbb4fqirz/full/%21192%2C/0/default\" data-video-title=\"Susa Young Gates and Joseph F. Smith\" data-video-description=\"Susa Young Gates learns about the spirit world from President Joseph F. Smith.\" data-video-id=\"6370053508112\" data-duration=\"200533\" data-assetId=\"pdqe3bydkvlu9y9i4mlkbk6e3pi2fk261r310aq3\" data-ref-id=\"pdqe3bydkvlu9y9i4mlkbk6e3pi2fk261r310aq3\" data-duration-string=\"3:20\" id=\"video7\"><source src=\"https://mediasrv.churchofjesuschrist.org/vod/stream/1241706627001/6370053508112.m3u8\" type=\"application/vnd.apple.mpegurl\" data-width=\"1920\" data-height=\"1080\" data-file-size=\"33603188\"/><source src=\"https://assets.churchofjesuschrist.org/pdqe3bydkvlu9y9i4mlkbk6e3pi2fk261r310aq3-360p-en.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\" data-width=\"640\" data-height=\"360\" data-file-size=\"11579092\"/><source src=\"https://assets.churchofjesuschrist.org/pdqe3bydkvlu9y9i4mlkbk6e3pi2fk261r310aq3-720p-en.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\" data-width=\"1280\" data-height=\"720\" data-file-size=\"18126322\"/><source src=\"https://assets.churchofjesuschrist.org/pdqe3bydkvlu9y9i4mlkbk6e3pi2fk261r310aq3-1080p-en.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\" data-width=\"1920\" data-height=\"1080\" data-file-size=\"33603188\"/></video><figcaption><header><p class=\"title\">Susa Young Gates and Joseph F. Smith</p></header></figcaption></figure>\n</section>\n<section id=\"sec_wKZZr\">\n<header>\n<p class=\"scripture-title\" data-aid=\"170148697\" id=\"p_rARfz\"><span class=\"legacy-scripture-ref\" data-legacy-href=\"../../scriptures/nt/matt/28.html?id=p1-p10#p1\">Mattheüs 28:1–10</span>; <span class=\"legacy-scripture-ref\" data-legacy-href=\"../../scriptures/nt/luke/24.html?id=p13-p48#p13\">Lukas 24:13–48</span>; <span class=\"legacy-scripture-ref\" data-legacy-href=\"../../scriptures/nt/john/20.html\">Johannes 20</span>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/3-ne/11?lang=nld&amp;id=p1-p17#p1\">3 Nephi 11:1–17</a></p>\n<h3 data-aid=\"170148717\" id=\"p_g9sVt\">Paaszondag: ‘Hij is opgewekt.’</h3>\n</header>\n<p data-aid=\"170148736\" id=\"p_nFJ1O\">Jezus Christus wil dat je weet dat Hij is opgestaan. Dat is de reden waarom Hij aan Maria, zijn discipelen en anderen is verschenen, en daarom zijn hun ervaringen bewaard gebleven: ‘opdat u gelooft dat Jezus de Christus is’ (<span class=\"legacy-scripture-ref\" data-legacy-href=\"../../scriptures/nt/john/20.html?id=p31#p31\">Johannes 20:31</span>).</p>\n<p data-aid=\"170148756\" id=\"p_fotIP\">Overpeins deze Pasen <span class=\"legacy-scripture-ref\" data-legacy-href=\"../../scriptures/nt/matt/28.html?id=p1-p10#p1\">Mattheüs 28:1–10</span>; <span class=\"legacy-scripture-ref\" data-legacy-href=\"../../scriptures/nt/luke/24.html?id=p13-p48#p13\">Lukas 24:13–48</span>; en <span class=\"legacy-scripture-ref\" data-legacy-href=\"../../scriptures/nt/john/20.html\">Johannes 20</span>. Concentreer je op de ervaringen van de mensen die getuige waren van de opstanding van de Heiland. Schrijf de getuigen eventueel in een tabel als deze:</p>\n<table class=\"vertical-axis\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p class=\"label\" data-aid=\"170148776\" id=\"p_lebfP\">Getuige</p>\n</th>\n<th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p class=\"label\" data-aid=\"170148795\" id=\"p_p5S4h\">Wat voegt de ervaring van deze getuige toe aan je begrip van deze heilige gebeurtenis?</p>\n</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><div class=\"card-label\">\n<p class=\"label\" data-aid=\"170148776\" id=\"p_lebfP\">Getuige</p>\n</div>\n<p data-aid=\"170148814\" id=\"p_tkyEM\">Maria</p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><div class=\"card-label\">\n<p class=\"label\" data-aid=\"170148776\" id=\"p_lebfP\">Getuige</p>\n</div>\n<p data-aid=\"170148833\" id=\"p_b3vAQ\">De twee discipelen onderweg naar Emmaüs</p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><div class=\"card-label\">\n<p class=\"label\" data-aid=\"170148776\" id=\"p_lebfP\">Getuige</p>\n</div>\n<p data-aid=\"170148852\" id=\"p_i7jpn\">Thomas</p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"></td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"></td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"></td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"></td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<ul class=\"bullet\">\n<li>\n<p data-aid=\"170148871\" id=\"p_kL2Xi\">Hoe heeft de Heiland jou laten weten dat Hij leeft?</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-aid=\"170148890\" id=\"p_hJRQ6\">Hoe verandert je levenswijze door te weten dat Hij leeft?</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-aid=\"170148909\" id=\"p_bU6O2\">Als heiligen der laatste dagen zijn we gezegend met extra getuigen van de opstanding van de Heiland. Zoek ze op in <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/3-ne/11?lang=nld&amp;id=p1-p17#p1\">3 Nephi 11:1–17</a> en ‘<a class=\"cross-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/the-living-christ-the-testimony-of-the-apostles/the-living-christ-the-testimony-of-the-apostles?lang=nld\">De levende Christus: het getuigenis van de apostelen</a>’ (Evangeliebibliotheek). Waarom zijn de getuigenissen van die getuigen waardevol voor je?</p>\n<p data-aid=\"170148928\" id=\"p_zQFsz\">Je kunt ook liederen over de verzoening en opstanding van de Heiland zingen of beluisteren, waaronder enkele die je minder bekend zijn (zie <cite><span class=\"legacy-cross-ref\" data-legacy-href=\"../../music/hymns-for-home-and-church\">Lofzangen – voor thuis en in de kerk</span></cite>).</p>\n<p data-aid=\"170148947\" id=\"p_kIuDw\">Zie ook ‘Jesus Is Resurrected’, ‘The Risen Lord Appears to the Apostles’, ‘Blessed Are They That Have Not Seen, and Yet Have Believed’ (video’s), Gospel Library; ‘He is Risen’ [Hij is opgewekt] ‘<a class=\"cross-ref\" href=\"/study/manual/new-testament-scripture-stories/47-jesus-comforts-two-disciples?lang=nld\">Jesus Comforts Two Disciples</a>’ [Jezus troost twee discipelen], in <cite>New Testament Stories</cite> [Verhalen uit het Nieuwe Testament].</p>\n<figure class=\"video\" id=\"figure13\"><video preload=\"none\" controls=\"controls\" poster=\"https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/377751db1c07c5bb5c9d81a426154bf3056b3258/full/%21768%2C/0/default\" thumbnail=\"https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/377751db1c07c5bb5c9d81a426154bf3056b3258/full/%21192%2C/0/default\" data-video-title=\"Jesus Is Resurrected\" data-video-description=\"Peter and John find the empty tomb. Jesus, now resurrected, appears to Mary.\" data-video-id=\"6380848654112\" data-ip=\"Download and Streaming                            \" data-duration=\"255000\" data-assetId=\"37e87b5dbe0cbe5e5543acb4d28eeff59fa069f2\" data-ref-id=\"37e87b5dbe0cbe5e5543acb4d28eeff59fa069f2\" data-duration-string=\"4:15\" id=\"video8\"><source src=\"https://mediasrv.churchofjesuschrist.org/vod/stream/1241706627001/6380848654112.m3u8\" type=\"application/vnd.apple.mpegurl\" data-width=\"1920\" data-height=\"1080\" data-file-size=\"83116814\"/><source src=\"https://assets.churchofjesuschrist.org/37e87b5dbe0cbe5e5543acb4d28eeff59fa069f2-360p-en.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\" data-width=\"640\" data-height=\"360\" data-file-size=\"18686425\"/><source src=\"https://assets.churchofjesuschrist.org/37e87b5dbe0cbe5e5543acb4d28eeff59fa069f2-720p-en.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\" data-width=\"1280\" data-height=\"720\" data-file-size=\"33048752\"/><source src=\"https://assets.churchofjesuschrist.org/37e87b5dbe0cbe5e5543acb4d28eeff59fa069f2-1080p-en.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\" data-width=\"1920\" data-height=\"1080\" data-file-size=\"83116814\"/></video><figcaption><header><p class=\"title\">Jesus Is Resurrected</p></header></figcaption></figure>\n<figure class=\"video\" id=\"figure14\"><video preload=\"none\" controls=\"controls\" poster=\"https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/2f0773a916051f443d7f448bcca971584c886e11/full/%21768%2C/0/default\" thumbnail=\"https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/2f0773a916051f443d7f448bcca971584c886e11/full/%21192%2C/0/default\" data-video-title=\"The Risen Lord Appears to the Apostles\" data-video-description=\"The resurrected Christ appears to the Apostles and tells them, “Peace be unto you.” They touch His hands and feet and He eats with them. He tells them He will send them as His Father sent Him. Luke 24:36–41, 44–49; John 20:21\" data-video-id=\"6380853374112\" data-ip=\"Download and Streaming                            \" data-duration=\"141683\" data-assetId=\"597068e271137f0d4a0620c9cb1670e70d03c363\" data-ref-id=\"597068e271137f0d4a0620c9cb1670e70d03c363\" data-duration-string=\"2:21\" id=\"video9\"><source src=\"https://mediasrv.churchofjesuschrist.org/vod/stream/1241706627001/6380853374112.m3u8\" type=\"application/vnd.apple.mpegurl\" data-width=\"1920\" data-height=\"1080\" data-file-size=\"59065080\"/><source src=\"https://assets.churchofjesuschrist.org/597068e271137f0d4a0620c9cb1670e70d03c363-360p-en.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\" data-width=\"640\" data-height=\"360\" data-file-size=\"9763067\"/><source src=\"https://assets.churchofjesuschrist.org/597068e271137f0d4a0620c9cb1670e70d03c363-720p-en.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\" data-width=\"1280\" data-height=\"720\" data-file-size=\"19808209\"/><source src=\"https://assets.churchofjesuschrist.org/597068e271137f0d4a0620c9cb1670e70d03c363-1080p-en.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\" data-width=\"1920\" data-height=\"1080\" data-file-size=\"59065080\"/></video><figcaption><header><p class=\"title\">The Risen Lord Appears to the Apostles</p></header></figcaption></figure>\n<figure class=\"video\" id=\"figure15\"><video preload=\"none\" controls=\"controls\" poster=\"https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/611175feaa47716aa03b165aa7fc9d7935a6a5ba/full/%21768%2C/0/default\" thumbnail=\"https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/611175feaa47716aa03b165aa7fc9d7935a6a5ba/full/%21192%2C/0/default\" data-video-title=\"Blessed Are They That Have Not Seen, and Yet Have Believed\" data-video-description=\"Thomas, one of the Twelve, doubts the appearance of the risen Lord. Christ appears and tells him, “Blessed are those who have not seen, and yet have believed.” John 20:24–29\" data-video-id=\"6380852609112\" data-ip=\"Download &amp; Streaming\" data-duration=\"147000\" data-assetId=\"a5413e7e60dc26f22125d3021d85f47166aac2a1\" data-ref-id=\"a5413e7e60dc26f22125d3021d85f47166aac2a1\" data-duration-string=\"2:27\" id=\"video10\"><source src=\"https://mediasrv.churchofjesuschrist.org/vod/stream/1241706627001/6380852609112.m3u8\" type=\"application/vnd.apple.mpegurl\" data-width=\"1920\" data-height=\"1080\" data-file-size=\"52241174\"/><source src=\"https://assets.churchofjesuschrist.org/a5413e7e60dc26f22125d3021d85f47166aac2a1-360p-en.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\" data-width=\"640\" data-height=\"360\" data-file-size=\"9311793\"/><source src=\"https://assets.churchofjesuschrist.org/a5413e7e60dc26f22125d3021d85f47166aac2a1-720p-en.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\" data-width=\"1280\" data-height=\"720\" data-file-size=\"18576292\"/><source src=\"https://assets.churchofjesuschrist.org/a5413e7e60dc26f22125d3021d85f47166aac2a1-1080p-en.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\" data-width=\"1920\" data-height=\"1080\" data-file-size=\"52241174\"/></video><figcaption><header><p class=\"title\">Blessed Are They That Have Not Seen, and Yet Have Believed</p></header></figcaption></figure>\n</section>\n</section>\n</div>\n<div class=\"resources\">\n<figure class=\"handout no-print\" id=\"fig_pvsjN\">\n<figure class=\"image no-print\" id=\"fig_gMPWu\">\n<img alt=\"Christus en Maria bij het graf\" data-scale=\"700\" id=\"img_stq4v\" src=\"https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/20f51bf0d4d9afbc9db902c1ce7c554ed8cdee1e/full/%21320%2C/0/default\" data-assetId=\"20f51bf0d4d9afbc9db902c1ce7c554ed8cdee1e\" srcset=\"https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/20f51bf0d4d9afbc9db902c1ce7c554ed8cdee1e/full/%2160%2C/0/default 60w,https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/20f51bf0d4d9afbc9db902c1ce7c554ed8cdee1e/full/%21100%2C/0/default 100w,https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/20f51