,https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/b8rp3mnlbqvdxcr16gyjgkn0x1234im2twzj1d6t/full/%21500%2C/0/default 500w,https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/b8rp3mnlbqvdxcr16gyjgkn0x1234im2twzj1d6t/full/%21640%2C/0/default 640w\" data-img-id=\"b8rp3mnlbqvdxcr16gyjgkn0x1234im2twzj1d6t\" data-missing-asset=\"false\" data-width=\"320\" data-height=\"415\" data-aspect-ratio=\"0.7710843373493976\"/>\n</a><a href=\"https://assets.churchofjesuschrist.org/65/xs/65xs1rzag78zko6ts3xy3d619sfcsv9b2qnto8gz/2027_come_follow_me_for_home_and_church_new_testament.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" data-icon=\"pdf\" class=\"open-pdf\">Pdf openen</a>\n</figure>\n</div>"
